From e5d89e11abb3832dc7bc7139f26cf6b50c8c1621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 21:12:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Kids Zone: engagement + polish sweep + Warrior Locker
 (additive modules only)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"Next level" pass for the Warrior Zone kids app, built entirely as self-installing
modules that fail safe (each guards its dependencies and no-ops if anything is
missing). No edits to the core bundles — safer to review and deploy.

New (kgz/app/features/):
- warrior-locker.js: the centerpiece. A full-screen hero view of the child's own
  warrior that suits up piece by piece in the armor they've EARNED (light +
  sound), with each piece teaching its Ephesians 6 verse (ESV) and meaning. A
  growing warrior title, and a next-piece quest using the real thresholds.
  Reuses armorSVG / getArmor / WZ_TIERS; launched from a button on the Armor tab.
  Scripture content passed the biblical-soundness review (ESV corrections).
- juice.js: per-answer sound + haptic feedback across all Arena games.
- streaks.js: streak strip + 12-sticker shelf in the Hall of Victory.
- today-plus.js: daily hub becomes a finishable mission (progress + celebration).
- armor-fix.js: armor numbers shown to kids now match the real unlock logic.
- polish.js: animated tab changes, points-earn pulse, hero sheen, soft tab tick.
- Three new Battle Arena games (age-aware, no timers/shaming, wz-award path):
    * books-game.js  — put the books of the Bible in order.
    * fruit-game.js  — collect the fruit of the Spirit (Galatians 5:22-23).
    * heroes-game.js — "Who Am I?" guess the Bible hero from clues.

Wiring: scripts load last in index.html with content-hash cache-busting; service
worker bumped wz-v2 -> wz-v3. Verified in headless Chromium: all 9 modules
self-install, three new games register (Arena 6 -> 12), the Locker renders and
suits up, no script errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
